{"ts":"2026-08-01T00:37:52.411Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"264406b88560fcdcbb17052e","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-08-01T00:37:52.411Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Delivery evidence 2026-08-01: receipts now distinguish declaration_feasible and result_omitted, omitted results always report within_budget:false, recovery never recommends an unprojected retry, and deterministic string then row compaction retains useful rows before receipt-only fallback. The checked 27-item fixture and all five live 2243-item tracker probes deliver feasible results; an explicit 256-token control proves truthful omission. Remaining acceptance before closure: publish and gate the required two-item versus current-scale calibration table rather than relying on the current small committed fixture plus manual live evidence."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-01T00:37:52.411Z"}],"before_hash":"3c9e29cff58e86cd2fdda3c8ff15951b5f4fc716d813b0faff210f1b8d1ea665","after_hash":"2a2133ea6308f7de43155be6d606b70a63a6760fb0b6404e4601dbf59bc9c340"}
